<div class="app">
<header class="topbar"><div class="brand"><div class="mark" aria-hidden="true">·</div><div><div class="wordmark"><span>YOUR</span><strong>DIGITAL TWIN</strong></div><small>LOCAL EDUCATIONAL SIMULATION / 01</small></div></div><div class="top-actions"><button class="btn ghost" id="privacyBtn">Data & privacy</button><button class="btn primary" id="startTop">Create twin</button></div></header>
<section class="hero" id="landing"><div><div class="eyebrow">An observatory for everyday choices</div><h1>YOUR <span>DIGITAL TWIN</span></h1><p class="hero-copy">Meet the version of you that your choices are creating. Explore how small decisions can shape different fictional trajectories—without pretending to know your actual future.</p><p class="hero-note">This is an educational simulation. It does not predict your actual future or diagnose your health, personality, intelligence, or mental state.</p><div class="hero-actions"><button class="btn primary" id="startBtn">Create my digital twin</button><button class="btn ghost" id="howBtn">How it works</button></div></div><div class="core-wrap" aria-label="Animated twin core visualization"><div class="core"><span class="core-dot"></span><i class="node n1"></i><i class="node n2"></i><i class="node n3"></i><i class="node n4"></i></div></div></section>
<section class="workspace" id="workspace"><div class="workspace-grid"><aside class="rail"><div class="rail-title">Twin creation</div><div class="rail-step current"><b>01</b> Daily rhythm</div><div class="rail-step"><b>02</b> Learning style</div><div class="rail-step"><b>03</b> Digital life</div><div class="rail-step"><b>04</b> Goals</div><div class="rail-step"><b>05</b> Decisions</div><div class="rail-step"><b>06</b> Curiosity</div><div class="rail-step"><b>07</b> Exploration</div><div class="rail-step"><b>08</b> Reflection</div></aside><main class="main"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Instrument / Twin creation</div><h2 id="flowTitle">Daily rhythm</h2></div><p id="flowSub">Broad, self-reported estimates. There are no right answers; the model only uses them to make a fictional simulation.</p></div><div class="progress"><i id="progressBar"></i></div><div class="question-view" id="questionView"></div><div class="nav-row"><button class="btn ghost" id="backBtn">Back</button><button class="btn primary" id="nextBtn">Next signal</button></div></main></div></section>
<section class="build" id="build"><div><div class="eyebrow">Local processing / no network</div><h2>Building your digital twin…</h2><div class="scanner"><i></i></div><p id="buildStage" style="color:var(--muted);margin-top:18px">Analyzing choices...</p></div></section>
<section class="report" id="report"><div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Twin initialized / fictional model</div><h2>Your possible futures</h2></div><p>Change an input, run an experiment, and observe how this educational model shifts. Nothing here is a prediction.</p></div><div class="disclaimer"><strong>SIMULATION METRIC.</strong> This is a deterministic educational model based on your answers. It does not measure real personality, intelligence, health, income, career, lifespan, or future behavior.</div><div class="report-grid"><div><div class="panel identity"><div><h3>Twin identity</h3><h2 id="twinName">The Signal Seeker</h2><div class="twin-type" id="twinSummary"></div></div><div><div class="eyebrow">Nickname</div><div id="nicknameDisplay" style="margin:7px 0 20px">—</div><div class="metric-grid" id="metrics"></div></div></div><div class="panel dna" style="margin-top:22px"><h3>Digital DNA / hover dimensions</h3><svg id="radar" viewBox="0 0 400 250" role="img" aria-label="Digital DNA radar chart"></svg></div></div><div><div class="panel"><h3>Central twin visualization</h3><div class="core-wrap" style="height:320px"><div class="core" id="reportCore"><span class="core-dot"></span><i class="node n1"></i><i class="node n2"></i><i class="node n3"></i><i class="node n4"></i></div></div><p class="report-copy" id="visualNote"></p></div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:22px"><h3>Your twin’s profile</h3><p class="report-copy" id="profile"></p><div class="split"><div><div class="eyebrow">Strengths</div><p class="report-copy" id="strengths"></p></div><div><div class="eyebrow">Growth opportunities</div><p class="report-copy" id="growth"></p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:22px"><h3>Possible trajectories / fictional scenarios</h3><div class="trajectory" id="trajectory"></div></div><div class="panel lab"><h3>What if? / change one signal</h3><p class="report-copy">Move one simulated behavior. The comparison below is deliberately fictional: it demonstrates how inputs change outputs.</p><div class="lab-controls"><label>Focus <output id="focusOut">50%</output><input id="focusLab" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label><label>Exploration <output id="exploreOut">50%</output><input id="exploreLab" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label><label>Consistency <output id="consistencyOut">50%</output><input id="consistencyLab" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label><label>Curiosity <output id="curiosityOut">50%</output><input id="curiosityLab" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50"></label></div><div class="compare"><div class="panel"><h3>Current twin</h3><div id="currentCompare"></div></div><div class="panel"><h3>Experimental twin</h3><div id="experimentalCompare"></div></div></div><button class="btn primary" id="runWhatIf" style="margin-top:16px">Run simulation</button></div><div class="panel challenges"><h3>Twin challenges / optional objectives</h3><div id="challengeList"></div></div><div class="panel history"><h3>Twin history / local only</h3><div class="history-list" id="historyList"></div><button class="btn ghost" id="eraseAll" style="margin-top:14px">Erase all twin data</button></div><div class="panel journal"><h3>Talk to your future self / structured reflection</h3><div class="journal-grid"><div><label for="j1">What would you like your future self to remember?</label><textarea class="text-input" id="j1"></textarea></div><div><label for="j2">What habit would you like to experiment with?</label><textarea class="text-input" id="j2"></textarea></div><div><label for="j3">What are you curious about right now?</label><textarea class="text-input" id="j3"></textarea></div><div><label for="j4">What would you like to learn?</label><textarea class="text-input" id="j4"></textarea></div></div><button class="btn primary" id="saveJournal" style="margin-top:14px">Save reflection locally</button></div><div class="panel" style="margin-top:22px"><h3>Achievements</h3><div id="achievements"></div></div><div class="hero-actions" style="margin-top:22px"><button class="btn primary" id="saveTwin">Save twin</button><button class="btn ghost" id="printBtn">Print / save as PDF</button><button class="btn ghost" id="newTwin">Create new twin</button><button class="btn ghost" id="resetBtn">Reset current</button></div><div class="print-only"><p>Educational simulation — not a prediction.</p></div></section>
